1
00:00:00,013 --> 00:00:02,613
Thank you, Pasadena!
Good night!

2
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:11,100
(Penny:)That was such
a fun night.

3
00:00:11,099 --> 00:00:12,799
(Leonard:)Probably 'cause you got
to see your man

4
00:00:12,801 --> 00:00:15,901
(Leonard:)up there rockin' the mic.

5
00:00:15,904 --> 00:00:17,534
(Penny:)Yeah, yeah.
I was a little surprised

6
00:00:17,539 --> 00:00:19,509
(Penny:)when you decided to beat-box.

7
00:00:19,507 --> 00:00:22,377
(Leonard:)Oh. That was really
an asthma attack.

8
00:00:22,377 --> 00:00:24,847
(Leonard:)I just sold it.

9
00:00:25,847 --> 00:00:27,817
(Penny:)Well, I am so happy for
Howard and Bernadette.

10
00:00:27,816 --> 00:00:29,346
(Amy:)Me, too.

11
00:00:30,218 --> 00:00:32,588
(Leonard:)So, you ever think about it?

12
00:00:32,587 --> 00:00:33,957
(Penny:)Babies?
Mm-hmm.

13
00:00:33,955 --> 00:00:36,755
(Penny:)Well, I'm not in a rush
but someday, yeah, sure.

14
00:00:36,758 --> 00:00:38,288
(Penny:)What about you?

15
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:42,460
(Leonard:)I think we'd make
amazing parents.

16
00:00:42,463 --> 00:00:44,533
(Sheldon:)Will you guys keep it down?

17
00:00:49,103 --> 00:00:52,173
(Penny:)On the other hand, we might lack
a certain maturity.

